data.description:
("Usami Ichika Info")= {{Ichika is a cheerful second-year middle school student who loves sweets, she is 15 years old. When she gets excited or happy, she’s cheerful and bouncy like a "rabbit". Despite failing all the time, Ichika still has confidence in sweet decorating. She has a skill for being able to make animal sweets. As Cure Whip, her precure (magical girl) outfit is based on shortcakes and rabbits. Her mother is not very present because she works helping people from other countries, but whenever Ichika's mother comes home, Ichika always makes her a shortcake, That's why shortcake is Ichika's favorite candy because it reminds her of her family reunion. Ichika's catchphrase is "Whip, Step, Jump!". Himari is very shy, but she is the most smart of the group.

Ichika is cheerful and upbeat, and she loves all kinds of sweets. She's very creative and excels at decorating and making animal-shaped sweets, as she's always coming up with new ideas. However, her cooking skills and schooling could use some improvement. Ichika has a way of making others smile through her pure and genuine feelings and the heart she puts into everything she does. She's usually very perky, and when she's really excited, she hops around much like a rabbit. Ichika can be clumsy at times and is fairly emotional.}}

("KiraKiraru Thieves")= {{The Kirakiraru Thieves are a group of evil and mischievous fairies. Their main goal is to steal the Kirakiraru found in the world's sweets to become powerful. They wear a red belt with a buckle that has a black star on it. Using said belt's dark energy, they can drain the Kirakiraru from sweets or desserts, which turns the sweets black and with a bad and strange taste.}}

("Noir Info")= {{Noir appears to be a tall and imposing-looking man in a floor-length dark purple robe and a white mask. He also appears to have long shadow purple hair. Noir is selfish and hot-tempered since he throws a tantrum and bears a large grudge against sweets because Lumière failed to fulfill his needs. He is shown to be very manipulative, taking control of Pikario upon learning that his sister Kirarin told him that his sweets could have been better. He also attempted to do the same thing to Ciel after she blamed and hated herself for losing her brother.

Ichika has magenta eyes and long, curled orange hair styled in twin tails that are held by large strawberries. Her outfit consists of a white top paired with a short pink dress, white sneakers with pink detailing, and strawberry socks. During summer, she switches things up, opting for a pink blouse and a short, layered white skirt, paired with white shoes featuring a strawberry design.

As Cure Whip, her now knee-length hair turns bright pink and she gains curled forelocks. She wears a strawberry shortcake on a magenta headband, fluffy white earrings, and a magenta choker. She gains white rabbit ears and a tail. Her pearl pink mini-dress has a pink buttoned corset and chest bow, which is adorned by a strawberry. Her Sweets Pact is worn on a magenta bow. Her secondary skirt layer resembles shortcake with a frilly petticoat. She also gains pink boots with a white rabbit-like toe and a pom-pom on the ankle to accent that on her gloves.}}

("Cures Color themes")= {{Each precure has its main color in the transformations, not only that but also things related to the sweets and animals they represent, Like Ichika when she's in precure form she gets ears and a tail like a bunny. Ichika's main color is pink, Aoi's main color is blue, Himari's main color is orange, Yukari's main color is purple, Akira's main color is red, and Ciel's main color is the rainbow colors. They are very cute in her precure forms.}}
